# Mark the vendored bwa-mem3 snapshot as generated AND vendored so GitHub
# collapses it by default in pull-request diffs and excludes it from language
# statistics. A vendor-bump PR touches hundreds of these files; the reviewable
# content is always the shim, build.rs, and the scripts alongside them.
#
# linguist-vendored as well as linguist-generated: the two control different
# things (stats vs. diff collapsing) and we want both.
bwa-mem3-sys/vendor/** linguist-generated=true
bwa-mem3-sys/vendor/** linguist-vendored=true
